COMPILATION OF: E52TF

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E52TF

   1 a 0000 E52TF: procedure options(main);
   2 c 0006    dcl printfile file;
   3 c 0006    dcl ps fixed bin, lw fixed bin;
   4 c 0006    dcl line char(14) varying;
   5 c 0006    open file(printfile) print pagesize(ps)
   6 c 0027         linesize(lw) title(line);
   7 c 0027    put list('tf');
   8 a 003E end E52TF;

CODE SIZE = 0041
DATA AREA = 0015
FREE SYMS = 3896
END  COMPILATION
